from ith stone can jump to i+1 or i+2 with cost |diff(stone j - stone i)|
find min cost to go from i to n

Approach =
state : dp[i] = min(dp[i-1]+(h[i]-h[i-1]) or dp[i-2]+(h[i]-h[i-2]))
